{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_863.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"410604b65f5239607ede18ec6b8bf4b8984cf346f48882c96421c31cc1ec0dc6","ja":"スーパービッグ★ニュース","zh":"超级大★新闻","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_863.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"5dd850245273c53d4304bf673902badc679fd0288cb1f9e8550d9ff8fbc9e58d","ja":"麗花ちゃん麗花ちゃん、大変だよ！\n大大大ニュースだよ～！！","zh":"丽花，丽花，不得了啦！  \n是超超超重大的新闻哦～！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_863.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"18cdfa0404667d05d40945540e924ec07c9bf7c841a091eaf1e9ee1d8badb271","ja":"えっ、大大大ニュース？\n山が歩いたとか、月が落ちてきたとか？","zh":"咦，超级超级超级大新闻？  \n是山走起来了，还是月亮掉下来了？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_863.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"7406e08f56944b5111bcf9f4c09c16254a8623726426f4843bcdccfdf79b65d6","ja":"あ、いや……そこまでいっちゃうと\n大大大大大大大大大大ニュースくらいかな……。","zh":"啊，不……要是夸张到那个地步，\n大概就算是超级超级超级超级超级超级超级超级超级超级大新闻了吧……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_863.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"f6704897e340d0c436b2f1fbb91cd82bb7fae671e78887e03efcc69e983cbb9f","ja":"でも、そのスケールの大きさ、さすが麗花ちゃん！\nビッグでカワイイ茜ちゃんの相方にふさわしいよ！","zh":"不过，这种规模之大，真不愧是丽花！作为又大又可爱的小茜的搭档，再合适不过了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_863.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"8c2e1fa9d16268a5dd283e5ce99ee1964244fdc0b16b2d4c4e6113ab0754aff0","ja":"わ～い、ほめられちゃった♪\n……それで、大大大ニュースって？","zh":"哇～被夸奖了♪  \n……所以，超级超级超级重磅的消息是什么？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_863.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"b365bd09d9e975a1cb32aebc56101e3c095eaa189faa031682d4453bac76130b","ja":"あ、そうだった。実は、\n今度開かれるお菓子メーカーのイベントで……。","zh":"啊，对了。其实，之后要举办的那个糖果厂商活动……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_863.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"42bf2d9ae283c978d17e4371667c307d9216f2882693e27a03d84b1992129c2b","ja":"『TRICK&TREAT』がメインMCを\n担当することが大決定したんだよ～！","zh":"『TRICK&TREAT』确定担任主MC啦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_863.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"841024ad56c255faf09226b4583924d27b9346ec3f133eaf27e8b5af6ac4e3fb","ja":"つまり今度も、茜ちゃんと麗花ちゃんが主役ってワケ！\n追い風来ちゃってるよ。世界制覇も秒読み段階だね！","zh":"也就是说，这次也是由小茜和丽花担任主角！\n顺风都吹起来了。称霸世界已经进入倒计时阶段啦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_863.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"eaca51885eeb96186571802037f2f95185ddfe0840276fb8ae44cd00355c49cf","ja":"わ～っ、すごいすご～い！\n茜ちゃんとまた一緒にイベントできるの、うれしいな♪","zh":"哇～，好厉害好厉害～！\n能和小茜再次一起参加活动，真开心♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_863.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"351d1124a2cc77a9c25d75b1a52eca74d0774950417583d40d8663487a11b39a","ja":"けど、こんなに早く次のハロウィンが来るなんて\n思ってなかったから、驚いちゃった。うるう年かな？","zh":"不过，没想到下一个万圣节这么快就到了，吓了我一跳。难道是闰年？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_863.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"5ca2138135e8c36c7e3466dc5c4ca91324f652bff9c29d8a39d9cae5bd7d9043","ja":"へ？　何言ってるの麗花ちゃん。\n今度のは、ハロウィンと関係ないイベントだよ。","zh":"诶？丽花，你在说什么呀。\n这次是和万圣节无关的活动哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_863.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"ad3f6cbb82ce5363bd7377b52ac62d13c7764192868476281e8392fba1706de0","ja":"そうなの？　『TRICK&TREAT』の出番なんだから、\nハロウィンなのかなって思ったんだけど。","zh":"是这样吗？因为轮到『TRICK&TREAT』登场，我还以为是万圣节呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_863.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"c047a73255cf86ede6ccf9225474cce5a3670cac23f4b288a3da86017c48d160","ja":"……ハッ！！\nそ……そう言われてみれば……！！","zh":"……啊！！\n这……这么一说，好像确实是……！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
